Assume the negation of the conclusion and derive a contradiction. Establish an intermediate fact. Rewrite the indicated hypotheses using the stated equalities. Separate the alternatives or extract the components of the hypothesis. Combine the linear equalities and inequalities to obtain the conclusion.

Use the polynomial consequences of the given equalities and inequalities. A detailed English derivation is pending.
